BUILD ENGLISH LEARNING HUB – WELCOME UNIT
Complete Product Build Instructions for Google AI Studio
You are building a new educational web application called English Learning Hub from scratch.

This is a commercial, multi-teacher English learning platform for young learners. The first release must implement the complete Welcome unit as a fully functional pilot. Do not build the full content of the other units yet.

Do not create only a visual prototype. Build functional screens, navigation, learning activities, progress tracking, assessment logic, and the required backend foundations.

1. PRODUCT VISION AND TECHNICAL FOUNDATION
Build a polished, child-friendly English learning platform with two distinct experiences:

Teacher experience: Professional dashboard for managing classes, students, learning progress, reports, and subscriptions.
Student experience: Colorful, simple, engaging learning environment focused on vocabulary mastery.
