7. STORY TIME – MONA’S FUN FESTIVAL
Create an illustrated children’s picture-book experience titled:

Mona’s Fun Festival

This is a short, easy story for young English learners.

Use a consistent cartoon illustration style and divide the story into five illustrated pages.

Do not show the entire story on one screen.

Story text
Page 1

Today is the school festival!

Mona looks at the calendar. The date is May 10. She is happy.

Page 2

She gets up early. She is not late.

She helps her mom prepare her bag. She puts a comic book inside.

Page 3

At the festival, Mona sees a tall mountain, a beautiful rainbow, and a little snail.

Page 4

Then she sees a big lion puppet!

“Have no fear, Mona!” says her friend.

Mona smiles. “How long is the show?”

“One hour!” says her friend.

Page 5

A year ago, Mona was afraid of lions. Now she is brave!

It is time to go home. Mona is tired but happy.

